  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/02ID">Remark <span data-tag="02ID">5.20.5</span>.</a> Combining Lemmas <a href="/tag/02IB" data-tag="02IB">5.20.3</a> and <a href="/tag/02IC" data-tag="02IC">5.20.4</a> we see that on a catenary, locally Noetherian, sober topological space the obstruction to having a dimension function is an element of $H^1(X, \mathbf{Z})$. </p>
